enggunakan data berdasarkan perilaku perusahaan sebelumnya, resume default Anda, dan faktor lainnya, {brand, select, seek {SEEK} jobsdb {Jobsdb} jobstreet {Jobstreet} other {SEEK}} memprediksi kapan Anda kemungkinan akan menjadi kandidat kuat untuk suatu jabatan dan dapat menampilkan informasi ini kepada Anda dan perusahaan.","If you do not have a default resume,...":"Jika Anda tidak memiliki resume default, resume yang digunakan dalam lamaran akan menjadi resume default Anda. Jika pengaturan visibilitas Anda ditetapkan ke Standar, perusahaan yang mencari kandidat di luar iklan lowongan kerja dapat melihat Profil {brand, select, seek {SEEK} jobsdb {Jobsdb} jobstreet {Jobstreet} other {SEEK}} dan resume default Anda.","In an application, we remove external links from documents to adhere to our security standards.":"Dalam lamaran, kami menghapus tautan eksternal dari dokumen untuk mematuhi standar keamanan kami.","If you delete a file from your profile after sending...":"Jika Anda menghapus file dari profil Anda setelah mengirimkannya dalam lamaran, perusahaan akan tetap memiliki akses ke file tersebut di platform {brand, select, seek {SEEK} jobsdb {Jobsdb} jobstreet {Jobstreet} other {SEEK}} untuk jangka waktu tertentu.","By uploading documents, you agree to our Collection Notice and Privacy Statement.":"Dengan mengunggah dokumen, Anda menyetujui Pemberitahuan Pengumpulan dan Pernyataan Privasi kami.","By uploading documents, you agree to our Collection Notice and Privacy Statement. [with links]":"Dengan mengunggah dokumen, Anda menyetujui <CollectionNoticeLink>Pemberitahuan Pengumpulan</CollectionNoticeLink> dan <PrivacyStatementLink>Pernyataan Privasi</PrivacyStatementLink> kami.","Privacy Statement":"Pernyataan Privasi","Collection Notice":"Pemberitahuan Pengumpulan"}')},46937:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"Jan":"Jan","Feb":"Feb","Mar":"Mar","Apr":"Apr","May":"Mei","Jun":"Jun","Jul":"Jul","Aug":"Agu","Sep":"Sep","Oct":"Okt","Nov":"Nov","Dec":"Des"}')},47022:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"Apply":"Daftar","Quick apply":"Lamaran Cepat","Unsave":"Batal simpan","Save":"Simpan","Apply for {jobTitle} at {jobCompanyName}":"Kirim lamaran sebagai {jobTitle} di {jobCompanyName}","Unsave {jobTitle} at {jobCompanyName}":"Batalkan penyimpanan {jobTitle} di {jobCompanyName}","Save {jobTitle} at {jobCompanyName}":"Simpan {jobTitle} di {jobCompanyName}","For more information, contact us on {phoneNumber}.":"Untuk informasi selengkapnya, hubungi kami di <TextLink>{phoneNumber}</TextLink>.","Company information":"Informasi perusahaan","About the recruiter":"Tentang rekruter","Employer questions":"Pertanyaan dari perusahaan","Your application will include the following questions:":"Lamaran kamu akan mencakup pertanyaan-pertanyaan berikut:","Fraudulent":"Penipuan","Discrimination":"Diskriminasi","Misleading":"Mengelirukan","We need an email address to get back to you.":"Kami memerlukan alamat email untuk menghubungi kamu kembali.","We need a reason for reporting this job.":"Kami memerlukan alasan untuk pelaporan lowongan kerja ini.","This field is required":"Kolom ini harus diisi","Report this job advert":"Laporkan iklan lowongan ini","Be careful":"Hati-hati","Don’t provide your bank or credit card details when applying for jobs.":"Jangan berikan detail bank atau kartu kredit kamu saat mengirimkan lamaran kerja.","This job ad has not been subjected to our hirer verification process...":"Iklan lowongan ini belum melalui proses verifikasi tim kami. Lanjutkan dengan hati-hati dan lakukan pemeriksaan mandiri sebelum memberikan informasi pribadi apa pun.","Learn how to protect yourself":"Pelajari cara melindungi diri kamu","Report this job ad":"Laporkan iklan lowongan ini","Thank you. Your job report has been forwarded to our job quality team.":"Terima kasih. Laporan Anda telah diteruskan ke tim kami.","It looks like something went wrong and your report could not be sent.":"Sepertinya terjadi masalah dan laporan kamu tidak dapat dikirim.","Your email address":"Alamat email kamu","Reason for reporting job":"Alasan pelaporan lowongan","Please select":"Silakan pilih","Additional comments":"Komentar tambahan","Report job":"Laporkan lowongan kerja","Cancel":"Batal","Check out this job on SEEK:":"Periksa pekerjaan ini di Jobstreet by SEEK:","You confirm that you’re at least 20 years old or have parental consent for JobsDB and affiliates to process your personal data. By submitting this information, you agree to our Privacy Policy.":"You confirm that you’re at least 20 years old or have parental consent for JobsDB and affiliates to process your personal data. By submitting this information, you agree to our <TextLink>Privacy Policy</TextLink>.","To help fast track investigation, please include here any other relevant details that prompted you to report this job ad as fraudulent / misleading / discriminatory.":"Untuk membantu mempercepat proses penyelidikan, kami akan sangat menghargai jika Anda bisa menambahkan informasi lainnya yang menunjukkan bahwa iklan ini terindikasi sebagai penipuan, menyesatkan, atau diskriminatif."}')},47210:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"No phone numbers allowed":"Nomor telepon tidak diizinkan "}')},47247:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"Filenames can\'t contain special characters...":"ชื่อไฟล์ต้องไม่มีเครื่องหมาย \\" \\\\ / กรุณาเปลี่ยนชื่อไฟล์"}')},47437:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"That\'s too easy to guess":"Terlalu mudah ditebak"}')},47830:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"Verifications":"[Ṽẽẽřììƒììçăăṯììööกี้š]","Joined brand in year":"[Ĵööììกี้ẽẽƌ {brand} ìììกี้ {year}]","Review and verified by brand\'s trust & safety team":"[Řẽẽṽììẽẽŵẽẽƌ ăăกี้ƌ ṽẽẽřììƒììẽẽƌ ßýý {brand}\'\'š Ṯřǚǚǚšṯ & Šăăăƒẽẽẽṯýýý Ṯẽẽẽăăăm̂]","More about this company":"[Ṃöööřẽẽẽ ăăăßöööǚǚǚṯ ṯḩìììš çöööm̂ƥăăăกี้ýýý]"}')},48314:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"Featured jobs":"{jobCount, plural, =1 {งานแนะนำ} other {งานแนะนำ}}"}')},48860:(e,n,a)=>{"use stric